<title>GERMANY: Adidas says plans ADR listing in U.S..</title>
<headline>Adidas says plans ADR listing in U.S..</headline>
<dateline>HERZOGENAURACH, Germany 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>German sportswear manufacturer Adidas AG said on Tuesday it hoped to list American Depositary Receipts (ADRs) on the U.S. stock market.</p>
<p>A spokesman said the company had not fixed a timetable for the ADR launch, but said it could occur in the second half of 1998.</p>
<p>The Boersen-Zeitung newspaper had cited Adidas chief executive Robert Louis-Dreyfus as saying the company was planning an ADR launch soon.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
